<title>USA: Unison HealthCare issues $100 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Unison HealthCare issues $100 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144 private placement debt issue from Unison HealthCare Corp was priced on Tuesday, according to a source close to the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER: UNISON HEALTHCARE CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MILLION    COUPON 12 1/4 PCT MATURITY 11/1/06</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE NA</p>
<p>LAST MOODY B3	 YIELD 12 1/4 PCT  PAY FREQ NA</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B   SPREAD 570	  CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES: Three year equity call for 25 percent of issue at 110 U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1662</p>
</text>
